 "meta_desc": "Ejercicios de matemáticas de 4.º grado de primaria: días, horas, minutos y segundos, convertir unidades de tiempo, duración de actividades, calendario y siglos. 100 ejercicios con respuestas.",
 "key_big": "1 h = 60 min; 1 min = 60 s",
 "key_sub": "1 día = 24 horas; 1 semana = 7 días.",
 "body_html": "<h2>Cómo se hace</h2><p>1 día = 24 horas; 1 hora = 60 minutos; 1 minuto = 60 <b>segundos</b>. Media hora son 30 minutos y un cuarto de hora, 15.</p><p>Para pasar de horas a minutos, <b>multiplica por 60</b>: 3 h = 180 min. Para pasar de minutos a horas, divide entre 60: 150 min = 2 h 30 min.</p><p>Para calcular cuánto dura algo, cuenta hasta la hora en punto y después el resto: de 9:40 a 11:15 son 20 min + 1 h + 15 min = 1 h 35 min.</p><div class='qfig'><svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 170 170' width='170' height='170' role='img' aria-label='reloj de agujas'><g font-family='Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif'><circle cx='85.0' cy='85.0' r='79.0' fill='#fff' stroke='#006633' stroke-width='4.2'/><path d='M92.6 12.3L93.0 8.9M100.2 13.5L100.9 10.2M107.6 15.5L108.6 12.3M114.7 18.2L116.1 15.1M128.0 25.8L130.0 23.1M133.9 30.7L136.2 28.2M139.3 36.1L141.8 33.8M144.2 42.0L146.9 40.0M151.8 55.3L154.9 53.9M154.5 62.4L157.7 61.4M156.5 69.8L159.8 69.1M157.7 77.4L161.1 77.0M157.7 92.6L161.1 93.0M156.5 100.2L159.8 100.9M154.5 107.6L157.7 108.6M151.8 114.7L154.9 116.1M144.2 128.0L146.9 130.0M139.3 133.9L141.8 136.2M133.9 139.3L136.2 141.8M128.0 144.2L130.0 146.9M114.7 151.8L116.1 154.9M107.6 154.5L108.6 157.7M100.2 156.5L100.9 159.8M92.6 157.7L93.0 161.1M77.4 157.7L77.0 161.1M69.8 156.5L69.1 159.8M62.4 154.5L61.4 157.7M55.3 151.8L53.9 154.9M42.0 144.2L40.0 146.9M36.1 139.3L33.8 141.8M30.7 133.9L28.2 136.2M25.8 128.0L23.1 130.0M18.2 114.7L15.1 116.1M15.5 107.6L12.3 108.6M13.5 100.2L10.2 100.9M12.3 92.6L8.9 93.0M12.3 77.4L8.9 77.0M13.5 69.8L10.2 69.1M15.5 62.4L12.3 61.4M18.2 55.3L15.1 53.9M25.8 42.0L23.1 40.0M30.7 36.1L28.2 33.8M36.1 30.7L33.8 28.2M42.0 25.8L40.0 23.1M55.3 18.2L53.9 15.1M62.4 15.5L61.4 12.3M69.8 13.5L69.1 10.2M77.4 12.3L77.0 8.9' stroke='#2b2b2b' stroke-width='1.0'/><path d='M85.0 16.9L85.0 8.5M119.0 26.0L123.2 18.8M144.0 51.0L151.2 46.8M153.1 85.0L161.5 85.0M144.0 119.0L151.2 123.2M119.0 144.0L123.2 151.2M85.0 153.1L85.0 161.5M51.0 144.0L